To my knowledge, the AnarchyPPL is the only active PPL. You were
automagically enrolled into PPL-1 when you joined the list, but that PPL is
in the process of ceasing to exist. I believe this was all in the welcome
message.

Perhaps I should have omitted that passage until I found out whether Harry
intends to continue that policy. I've sent him a private query.

If Harry requires that people belong to some PPL, that would dump everyone
into mine, or they'd have to leave the list. Nobody wants to see people
leave the list over this, and that goes double for me. Nor do I want to see
a reprise of the PPL wars. It's been quite pleasant that no judiciary
actions have been necessary over the past few months.

I believe that this nothing to worry about. We'll figure out what we want
to do about it presently. In the mean time, if you have a strong opinion or
suggestions feel free to send them to Harry (habs@panix.com) and myself
(plaz@netcom.com), or discuss them here on the list.

